('wikiloc', '24248863', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/itxassou-mondarrain-itxassou-24248863', 'Itxassou - Mondarrain - Itxassou', '{"en":"Easy loop from Itxassou village","ca":"Circular fàcil des del poble d''Itxassou","es":"Circular fácil desde el pueblo de Itxassou"}'::jsonb, 'Itxassou - Mondarrain - Itxassou Hiking trail in Itxassou, Nouvelle-Aquitaine (France). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Walk around the town of Itxassou, in the French Basque country, with half way an optional side track up to mountain Mondarrain. Good for rich perfumes of all the blooming blossoms and spectacular views of the mountains and even the sea.', '{"en":"This easy 15.3 km loop from Itxassou climbs 826m, offering a walk around the town with an optional side trip to Mondarrain.\n\nThe route explores the surroundings of Itxassou in the French Basque Country. It features pleasant paths with rich floral scents and expansive views of the mountains and even the sea.\n\nThe ascent to Mondarrain is presented as an optional detour, making this route flexible for hikers seeking either a gentler stroll or a more challenging climb to the summit.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 15,3 km des d''Itxassou puja 826m, oferint una passejada pels voltants del poble amb una excursió opcional al Mondarrain.\n\nLa ruta explora els voltants d''Itxassou al País Basc francès. Presenta camins agradables amb rics perfums florals i vistes extenses de les muntanyes i fins i tot del mar.\n\nL''ascens al Mondarrain es presenta com un desviament opcional, fent aquesta ruta flexible per als excursionistes que busquen una passejada més suau o una pujada més exigent al cim.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 15,3 km desde Itxassou asciende 826m, ofreciendo un paseo por los alrededores del pueblo con una excursión opcional al Mondarrain.\n\nLa ruta explora los alrededores de Itxassou en el País Vasco francés. Presenta caminos agradables con ricos perfumes florales y vistas extensas de las montañas e incluso del mar.\n\nEl ascenso al Mondarrain se presenta como un desvío opcional, haciendo esta ruta flexible para los excursionistas que buscan un paseo más suave o una subida más exigente a la cumbre."}'::jsonb, 'dutchkind', 15257, 826, 826, 741, 52, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 20700, 1457, '2018-04-22', '2018-03', '[{"lat":43.325305,"lng":-1.405505,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325325,"lng":-1.405532,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325334,"lng":-1.405524,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325315,"lng":-1.405552,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325314,"lng":-1.405555,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325325,"lng":-1.405534,"ele":59},{"lat":43.325331,"lng":-1.405476,"ele":59},{"lat":43.325367,"lng":-1.405456,"ele":59},{"lat":43.325362,"lng":-1.405404,"ele":59},{"lat":43.32538,"lng":-1.405387,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325368,"lng":-1.405399,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325337,"lng":-1.405437,"ele":60},{"lat":43.325369,"lng":-1.405453,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325344,"lng":-1.405494,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325331,"lng":-1.405479,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325354,"lng":-1.40542,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325364,"lng":-1.405447,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325345,"lng":-1.405474,"ele":62},{"lat":43.325433,"lng":-1.405451,"ele":63},{"lat":43.325611,"lng":-1.40529,"ele":63},{"lat":43.325625,"lng":-1.405269,"ele":63},{"lat":43.325776,"lng":-1.405114,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325826,"lng":-1.405088,"ele":61},{"lat":43.325942,"lng":-1.405097,"ele":59},{"lat":43.32598,"lng":-1.405127,"ele":59},{"lat":43.326165,"lng":-1.405134,"ele":58},{"lat":43.32622,"lng":-1.405043,"ele":57},{"lat":43.32633,"lng":-1.404838,"ele":56},{"lat":43.326451,"lng":-1.404656,"ele":54},{"lat":43.32651,"lng":-1.404606,"ele":53},{"lat":43.326554,"lng":-1.404604,"ele":53},{"lat":43.326579,"lng":-1.404522,"ele":53},{"lat":43.326634,"lng":-1.404498,"ele":53},{"lat":43.32666,"lng":-1.404457,"ele":53},{"lat":43.32675,"lng":-1.40446,"ele":53},{"lat":43.326788,"lng":-1.404446,"ele":52},{"lat":43.32687,"lng":-1.404432,"ele":52},{"lat":43.327107,"lng":-1.40439,"ele":52},{"lat":43.32727,"lng":-1.40432,"ele":52},{