- Sospetxu (14.6 km)', '{"en":"This moderate 17.5 km one-way traverse from Elgeta to Bergara covers 468m of elevation gain, requiring vehicle coordination or a taxi. The route is rich in historical context, detailing the most important battle of the Spanish Civil War in the Basque Country.\n\nStarting from Elgeta''s town square, the trail leads to the Asentzio hermitage and pass, a key battleground with explanatory panels and memorials. From this pass, ascend to the summit of Intxorta (743m), marked by a hut and weathervane.\n\nContinue along a ridge, linking various passes and crossing the Kanpanzar Pass road, to reach the summit of Irutontorreta (623m) before descending into Bergara.","ca":"Aquesta travessa moderada de 17.5 km des d''Elgeta a Bergara, amb 468m de desnivell positiu, requereix coordinació de vehicles o un taxi. La ruta és rica en context històric, detallant la batalla més important de la Guerra Civil Espanyola al País Basc.\n\nComençant des de la plaça d''Elgeta, el sender porta a l''ermita i coll d''Asentzio, un camp de batalla clau amb panells explicatius i memorials. Des d''aquest coll, s''ascendeix al cim d''Intxorta (743m), marcat per una caseta i un penell.\n\nContinueu per una carena, enllaçant diversos colls i creuant la carretera del Port de Kanpanzar, per arribar al cim d''Irutontorreta (623m) abans de descendir cap a Bergara.","es":"Esta travesía moderada de 17.5 km desde Elgeta a Bergara, con 468m de desnivel positivo, requiere coordinación de vehículos o un taxi. La ruta es rica en contexto histórico, detallando la batalla más importante de la Guerra Civil Española en el País Vasco.\n\nComenzando desde la plaza de Elgeta, el sendero lleva a la ermita y collado de Asentzio, un campo de batalla clave con paneles explicativos y memoriales. Desde este collado, se asciende a la cima de Intxorta (743m), marcada por una caseta y una veleta.\n\nContinúe por una cuerda, enlazando varios collados y cruzando la carretera del Puerto de Kanpanzar, para llegar a la cima de Irutontorreta (623m) antes de descender hacia Bergara."}'::jsonb, 'Vardaman2', 17494, 468, 781, 738, 150, 'moderate', 'one-way', NULL, 28320, 1704, '2025-12-18', '2025-11', '[{"lat":43.13671,"lng":-2.487519,"ele":466.2},{"lat":43.136735,"lng":-2.487627,"ele":465.9},{"lat":43.136707,"lng":-2.487693,"ele":465.5},{"lat":43.136676,"lng":-2.487708,"ele":465.3},{"lat":43.136614,"lng":-2.487695,"ele":465.1},{"lat":43.136578,"lng":-2.487665,"ele":465},{"lat":43.136565,"lng":-2.487668,"ele":464.9},{"lat":43.136554,"lng":-2.48768,"ele":464.8},{"lat":43.136534,"lng":-2.487716,"ele":464.6},{"lat":43.136537,"lng":-2.48779,"ele":464.5},{"lat":43.136508,"lng":-2.487813,"ele":464.4},{"lat":43.136297,"lng":-2.487925,"ele":464.2},{"lat":43.136065,"lng":-2.48808,"ele":465},{"lat":43.135865,"lng":-2.488175,"ele":465.4},{"lat":43.135667,"lng":-2.488319,"ele":466.5},{"lat":43.135538,"lng":-2.488385,"ele":467.3},{"lat":43.135467,"lng":-2.488477,"ele":468.3},{"lat":43.135301,"lng":-2.488601,"ele":470.7},{"lat":43.13529,"lng":-2.488635,"ele":471},{"lat":43.135141,"lng":-2.488675,"ele":472.6},{"lat":43.135023,"lng":-2.488643,"ele":473.8},{"lat":43.134985,"lng":-2.488623,"ele":474.2},{"lat":43.134887,"lng":-2.488631,"ele":475.3},{"lat":43.13477,"lng":-2.48859,"ele":476.3},{"lat":43.13475,"lng":-2.488586,"ele":476.4},{"lat":43.134569,"lng":-2.488472,"ele":477.2},{"lat":43.134373,"lng":-2.488448,"ele":478.7},{"lat":43.134186,"lng":-2.488489,"ele":480.7},{"lat":43.13417,"lng":-2.488494,"ele":480.9},{"lat":43.133923,"lng":-2.488568,"ele":483.8},{"lat":43.133901,"lng":-2.488575,"ele":484.1},{"lat":43.133867,"lng":-2.488581,"ele":484.5},{"lat":43.133823,"lng":-2.488592,"ele":485.1},{"lat":43.133779,"lng":-2.488592,"ele":485.4},{"lat":43.133566,"lng":-2.488603,"ele":487.3},{"lat":43.133385,"lng":-2.488608,"ele":489.4},{"lat":43.133177,"lng":-2.488589,"ele":491.8},{"lat":43.133004,"lng":-2.488574,"ele":493.8},{"lat":43.132986,"lng":-2.488566,"ele":493.8},{"lat":43.132968,"lng"